   "lines": [
    "Went out sailing",
    "for ducks. The wind",
    "was light and",
    "baffling and we",
    "saw but few birds",
    "but had capital fun.",
    "We got into a flock",
    "of coots and I",
    "knocked down two;",
    "I killed a checker-",
    "back loon after",
    "a long chase;",
    "and missed a",
    "shot at an old",
    "squaw; we saw some",
    "grebes but could not",
    "get near them."
   ],
